NAME
  install - install Freax onto a writable disk

SYNOPSIS
  install [--from=ADDRESS] [--to=ADDRESS]

DESCRIPTION
  Copies files listed by /manifest from Freax source media to a target OC
  filesystem using 4K streaming. The source/target addresses may be unique
  prefixes. Explicit missing or ambiguous prefixes are rejected.

  Installer skips read-only filesystems, current source media, boot disk,
  and tmpfs unless tmpfs is explicitly selected with --to. It creates the
  root account database, preserves /home when available, verifies critical
  boot files, sets the target label and boot address, then offers reboot.

  Requires effective UID 0 and a second writable disk.

OPTIONS
  --from=ADDRESS
    Pin installer source filesystem.

  --to=ADDRESS
    Pin target filesystem.

  --help
    Show command usage.

SEE ALSO
  webinstall, apt
